<h3><u>Behta pani</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><span data-ft="{"tn":"K"}" class="userContent">Aag seene me lagata raha behta pani<br> Bade ashur aseero ne..(2)<br> jo dekha pani<br> Aag seene me........<br> <br> Jab alamdar ke bazu ko kalam dekhliya<br> Phr aseero ne kisi se bhi na maanga pani...<br> aag seene....<br> <span class="text_exposed_show"><br> Ek hasrat se woh darya ki taraf dekhti hai<br> Bachhe aa aa ke jo kehte hai sakina pani<br> Aag seene me...<br> <br> Wada asghar se nibhate hue dam tod gai<br> Saye me aai na maa ne piya thanda pani<br> Aag seene me....<br> <br> Kash saqlain mere khwab ko tabeer mile<br> Marde dam mere gale se nahi utra pani.<br> Aag seene me...</span></span></p>
                